WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.159
VenueSprocket helps restaurants, bars
and breweries book private events.

2
00:00:06.459 --> 00:00:11.483
Create a free account with your name,
email, a password and your venue's name.

3
00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:14.595
Your inquiry page is live
as soon as you finish.

4
00:00:15.695 --> 00:00:19.757
Share the link, or add a booking
button to your website from Settings.

5
00:00:20.462 --> 00:00:22.844
Here's a guest planning a rehearsal dinner.

6
00:00:23.011 --> 00:00:27.230
She picks the event type, date and
guest count on her phone, and sends it.

7
00:00:27.394 --> 00:00:28.791
No account needed.

8
00:00:29.891 --> 00:00:33.825
The inquiry lands in your dashboard
as a new lead, with the date,

9
00:00:33.865 --> 00:00:36.171
guest count and contact details.

10
00:00:36.691 --> 00:00:39.864
Turn the lead into an event,
then build a proposal:

11
00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:43.871
a room fee, a food and beverage
minimum, and a deposit.

12
00:00:43.989 --> 00:00:45.851
Send it as a secure link.

13
00:00:46.951 --> 00:00:50.800
Your customer reviews the
proposal and accepts it online.

14
00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:53.497
Generate the contract.

15
00:00:53.663 --> 00:00:58.458
The guest signs with a typed signature,
then can pay the deposit through Stripe.

16
00:00:59.558 --> 00:01:02.148
Then build the banquet
event order for your team:

17
00:01:02.331 --> 00:01:07.012
room setup, food, beverage,
staffing and AV, with a print view.

18
00:01:08.112 --> 00:01:10.778
Free covers your inquiry page and leads.

19
00:01:10.945 --> 00:01:14.175
Starter, $29 a month, adds proposals.

20
00:01:14.392 --> 00:01:19.129
Pro, $79, adds contracts, deposits and BEOs.

21
00:01:20.229 --> 00:01:22.989
Start free at venuesprocket.com.
